  "intended_use": "Research and development use inside the Velos/SPARK platform: optional refinement of ePIE reconstructions of reduced visible-light ptychography scans (about 35-80 % of a dense raster), followed by the hybrid physics polish. The physics result is always kept and returned alongside.",
  "limitations": [
    "Trained on simulated cell phantoms and ONE experimental specimen (635 nm clam section, left 65 % of the field); tested on held-out regions/frame draws and one unseen specimen (675 nm plant section). Not validated on biological cell samples \u2014 required before any claim (M4).",
    "Outputs are estimates, not measurements. Use the data-consistency check: if the refined object fits the measured diffraction data much worse than the physics result, prefer the physics or hybrid result.",
    "Pixel sizes / probe sizes outside the training range (about 5-10 \u00b5m pixels at 128-px frames; 64-px simulated probes) are out of distribution."
